# blitzy/acceleration-report/ workspace .gitignore
#
# This file is scoped to the acceleration-report workspace. The repository-root
# .gitignore is not modified by this deliverable.
#
# Data-artifact tracking policy (revised for CP2 review remediation):
#   The data/ directory contains TWO classes of artifact:
#     (a) Committed seed artifacts (deliverable evidence). These are
#         explicitly UN-ignored below via "!data/<name>" entries. They are
#         the provenance trail required by Rule 1 (Data Provenance), Rule 5
#         (Reproducibility), and Rule 6 (Environment First), and they
#         underpin the Reproducibility Appendix in acceleration-report.md.
#     (b) Per-run regenerable artifacts not currently listed below. Anything
#         NOT explicitly un-ignored falls under the generic data/* glob and
#         is treated as transient output.
#   The directory marker .gitkeep is preserved so the path exists on a fresh
#   clone.

# --- Python virtual environment (workspace-local) ---
.venv/
venv/
.python-version

# --- Local environment overrides (never commit secrets) ---
.env
.env.local
*.env.local

# --- Python bytecode and caches ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Per-run extraction artifacts (regenerable; un-ignore deliverables below) ---
data/*.json
data/*.csv
data/*.jsonl
data/.cursor.json
!data/.gitkeep

# --- Committed deliverable artifacts (CP2 scope; tracked) ---
# Each line below un-ignores a single required artifact. New committed
# artifacts are added one per line; do NOT broaden these globs because the
# directory-level glob above is the safety net for per-run transient files.
!data/environment.json
!data/inflection.json
!data/commits.csv
!data/revert_candidates.csv
!data/pulls.json
!data/reviews.json
!data/pull_events.json
!data/releases.json
!data/reverts.json
!data/ci_runs.json
!data/test_transitions.json
!data/exceptions.json
!data/issues.json
!data/slas.json
!data/metrics.json
!data/per_engineer.json
!data/run.log.jsonl

# --- Rendered intermediate artifacts (deterministic; regenerable) ---
# The final acceleration-report.md and executive-summary.html ARE committed.
# Intermediate caches used during rendering are not.
.render_cache/

# --- OS / editor noise ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
